# Hash-locked research artifacts must be byte-identical on every OS.
# Without this, Git on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) converts LF to CRLF on checkout and the
# published SHA256 checks fail. See PROJECT_AUDIT.md finding R6.
*.json  -text
*.csv   -text
*.npy   binary
*.npz   binary
*.onnx  binary
*.pt    binary
*.sqlite binary
